  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "generated" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaTELToContactPointConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaTELToContactPointConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaTELToContactPointConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TEL.html\">TEL: TelecommunicationAddress (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint\">ContactPoint</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TEL.html#s-TEL.value\">TEL.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint#s-ContactPoint.value\">ContactPoint.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>La valeur TEL alimente ContactPoint.value après suppression du préfixe technique tel:, fax:, mailto:, http: ou https:.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\" style=\"opacity: 0.5\">\"</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint#s-ContactPoint.system\">ContactPoint.system</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le système cible est déterminé à partir du préfixe de TEL.value : tel -&gt; phone, fax -&gt; fax, mailto -&gt; email, http/https -&gt; url.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TEL.html#s-TEL.use\">TEL.use</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint#s-ContactPoint.use\">ContactPoint.use</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Les usages CDA sont convertis vers les usages FHIR : H -&gt; home ; WP, DIR ou PUB -&gt; work ; BAD -&gt; old ; TMP -&gt; temp ; MC -&gt; mobile.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TEL.html#s-TEL.useablePeriod\">TEL.useablePeriod</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint#s-ContactPoint.period\">ContactPoint.period</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td>La période d’utilisation du point de contact CDA alimente directement ContactPoint.period.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap CdaTELToContactPointConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"en-CdaTELToContactPointConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcCdaTELToContactPointConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TEL.html\">TEL: TelecommunicationAddress (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#ContactPoint\">ContactPoint</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TEL.html#s-TEL.value\">TEL.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relations